  m_Text: This demo uses Unity-Chan mostly to show RASCAL working with a more complex
    and nice to look at mesh. The different colors on the collision mesh visualization
    represent each different bone-mesh that is generated. You can try changing settings
    on the RASCAL component on the unitychan object and restarting this demo to observe
    how it effects the output. Also on the RASCAL component is an example of material
    associations to physics materials and an example of an excluded material.
